{"id":"69407d4d0243b2de","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-gl-tableau.md","title":"Window Tableaux for GL","display":"df-gl-tableau — Window Tableaux for GL","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-gl-tableau","aliases":["89-df-gl-tableau"],"display":"df-gl-tableau — Window Tableaux for GL","depends_on":["[[89-df-modal-formula]]"],"created":"2026-10-05","revised":"2026-10-05"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-gl-tableau"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-gl-tableau</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-gl-tableau — Window Tableaux for GL"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"56c1b5b75a32ca1d\" href=\"?note=56c1b5b75a32ca1d\" title=\"89-df-modal-formula\">89-df-modal-formula</a></span></div>"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-05"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-05"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>下标 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GL}\">\\(\\mathrm{GL}\\)</span> 是系统名称标签；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Tab}_{\\mathrm{GL}}\">\\(\\mathsf{Tab}_{\\mathrm{GL}}\\)</span> 由下文构造，不预先假定其存在。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(\\Gamma\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span> 是有限公式序列，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\\subseteq\\operatorname{dom}(\\Gamma)\">\\(E\\subseteq\\operatorname{dom}(\\Gamma)\\)</span> 是已检查的出现位置。</li>\n<li>分支记录 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b=(\\Gamma,E,\\mathcal U)\">\\(b=(\\Gamma,E,\\mathcal U)\\)</span> 中，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal U\">\\(\\mathcal U\\)</span> 是分支上各窗口内的真值树序列。不同出现以有限树地址区分，即使其记录相同。</li>\n<li>下式中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\">\\(m\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\)</span>，各 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma_j\">\\(\\Gamma_j\\)</span> 为有限公式序列，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E_j\\subseteq\\operatorname{dom}(\\Gamma_j)\">\\(E_j\\subseteq\\operatorname{dom}(\\Gamma_j)\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}gl\\text{-}tableau}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal Q&amp;\\coloneqq\\{(\\Gamma,E)\\mid\\Gamma\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}^{&lt;\\omega},\\ E\\subseteq\\operatorname{dom}(\\Gamma)\\},\\\\\n\\mathsf{Tab}_0&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\langle(\\Gamma_j,E_j,\\langle\\rangle)\\mid j&lt;m\\rangle\\mid\nm\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\},\\ \\langle(\\Gamma_j,E_j)\\mid j&lt;m\\rangle\\in\\mathcal Q^m\\},\\\\\n\\mathsf{Tab}_{n+1}&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathsf{Tab}_n\\cup\n\\{\\langle(\\Gamma_j,E_j,\\mathcal U_j)\\mid j&lt;m\\rangle\\mid\nm\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\},\\ \\langle(\\Gamma_j,E_j)\\mid j&lt;m\\rangle\\in\\mathcal Q^m,\\\n\\langle\\mathcal U_j\\mid j&lt;m\\rangle\\in(\\mathsf{Tab}_n^{&lt;\\omega})^m\\},\\\\\n\\mathsf{Tab}_{\\mathrm{GL}}&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}\\mathsf{Tab}_n,\\\\\n\\deg(T)&amp;\\coloneqq\\max\\bigl(\\{0\\}\\cup\n\\{1+\\deg(\\mathcal U_j(k))\\mid j&lt;|T|,\\ k&lt;|\\mathcal U_j|\\}\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}gl\\text{-}tableau}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal Q&amp;\\coloneqq\\{(\\Gamma,E)\\mid\\Gamma\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}^{&lt;\\omega},\\ E\\subseteq\\operatorname{dom}(\\Gamma)\\},\\\\\n\\mathsf{Tab}_0&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\langle(\\Gamma_j,E_j,\\langle\\rangle)\\mid j&lt;m\\rangle\\mid\nm\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\},\\ \\langle(\\Gamma_j,E_j)\\mid j&lt;m\\rangle\\in\\mathcal Q^m\\},\\\\\n\\mathsf{Tab}_{n+1}&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathsf{Tab}_n\\cup\n\\{\\langle(\\Gamma_j,E_j,\\mathcal U_j)\\mid j&lt;m\\rangle\\mid\nm\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\},\\ \\langle(\\Gamma_j,E_j)\\mid j&lt;m\\rangle\\in\\mathcal Q^m,\\\n\\langle\\mathcal U_j\\mid j&lt;m\\rangle\\in(\\mathsf{Tab}_n^{&lt;\\omega})^m\\},\\\\\n\\mathsf{Tab}_{\\mathrm{GL}}&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}\\mathsf{Tab}_n,\\\\\n\\deg(T)&amp;\\coloneqq\\max\\bigl(\\{0\\}\\cup\n\\{1+\\deg(\\mathcal U_j(k))\\mid j&lt;|T|,\\ k&lt;|\\mathcal U_j|\\}\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Boolos, <em>The Logic of Provability</em>，第 10 章 pp.141–142。印刷页 p 对应 PDF 第 p+39 页。</p>\n<p>本条把原书的图示真值树编码成有限嵌套分支序列；这是一种本目录编码约定。所有记录在 Assertion 的集合构造中显式受域约束；度数式中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T(j)=(\\Gamma_j,E_j,\\mathcal U_j)\">\\(T(j)=(\\Gamma_j,E_j,\\mathcal U_j)\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>每个阶段是集合；阶段并集也是集合。窗口嵌套深度有限，度数递归沿严格子树下降。树内至少有一个分支，但公式序列和窗口序列均可为空。窗口中的公式属于子分支，不属于外层分支。</p>\n<p>这类真值树与 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"cd488da32dcaca7b\" href=\"?note=cd488da32dcaca7b\" title=\"89-df-gl-tree-frame\">89-df-gl-tree-frame</a> 的关系框架不同；这里只定义前者，后一链接是术语比较，不是数学依赖。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-modal-formula","status":"resolved","id":"56c1b5b75a32ca1d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-modal-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-gl-tree-frame","status":"resolved","id":"cd488da32dcaca7b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"这类真值树与 [[89-df-gl-tree-frame]] 的关系框架不同；这里只定义前者，后一链接是术语比较，不是数学依赖。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{GL}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Tab}_{\\mathrm{GL}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"E\\subseteq\\operatorname{dom}(\\Gamma)","display":false},{"tex":"b=(\\Gamma,E,\\mathcal U)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal U","display":false},{"tex":"m\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma_j","display":false},{"tex":"E_j\\subseteq\\operatorname{dom}(\\Gamma_j)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}gl\\text{-}tableau}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal Q&\\coloneqq\\{(\\Gamma,E)\\mid\\Gamma\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}^{<\\omega},\\ E\\subseteq\\operatorname{dom}(\\Gamma)\\},\\\\\n\\mathsf{Tab}_0&\\coloneqq\\{\\langle(\\Gamma_j,E_j,\\langle\\rangle)\\mid j<m\\rangle\\mid\nm\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\},\\ \\langle(\\Gamma_j,E_j)\\mid j<m\\rangle\\in\\mathcal Q^m\\},\\\\\n\\mathsf{Tab}_{n+1}&\\coloneqq\\mathsf{Tab}_n\\cup\n\\{\\langle(\\Gamma_j,E_j,\\mathcal U_j)\\mid j<m\\rangle\\mid\nm\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\},\\ \\langle(\\Gamma_j,E_j)\\mid j<m\\rangle\\in\\mathcal Q^m,\\\n\\langle\\mathcal U_j\\mid j<m\\rangle\\in(\\mathsf{Tab}_n^{<\\omega})^m\\},\\\\\n\\mathsf{Tab}_{\\mathrm{GL}}&\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}\\mathsf{Tab}_n,\\\\\n\\deg(T)&\\coloneqq\\max\\bigl(\\{0\\}\\cup\n\\{1+\\deg(\\mathcal U_j(k))\\mid j<|T|,\\ k<|\\mathcal U_j|\\}\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"T(j)=(\\Gamma_j,E_j,\\mathcal U_j)","display":false}],"bytes":2477,"backlinks":[{"id":"b0e5598f570a6835","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"05a599f85e508061","anchor":"ref-85","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-df-gl-tableau]]"},{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-123","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[89-df-gl-tableau]] → [[89-df-gl-tableau-characteristic]] → [[89-lem-gl-tableau-window]] → [[89-df-gl-tableau-procedure]] → [[89-lem-gl-tableau-termination]] → [[89-lem-gl-tableau-closed-soundness]] → [[89-lem-gl-tableau-open-countermodel]] → [[89-thm-gl-tableau-decision]]"}],"outgoing":["56c1b5b75a32ca1d","cd488da32dcaca7b"]}